1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,520
You just swallowed your gum,

2
00:00:01,520 --> 00:00:03,280
and everyone says it will sit inside

3
00:00:03,280 --> 00:00:04,640
you for seven years.

4
00:00:04,640 --> 00:00:06,480
But your gut doesn't work like that.

5
00:00:06,480 --> 00:00:08,560
Gum is mostly a rubbery lump that

6
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:10,080
your body can't digest.

7
00:00:10,080 --> 00:00:12,000
Can't digest isn't the same as can't

8
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:12,480
leave.

9
00:00:12,480 --> 00:00:14,320
Your gut squeezes everything along,

10
00:00:14,320 --> 00:00:16,000
one slow wave at a time.

11
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:17,680
The sweet parts dissolve,

12
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:19,360
and the rubbery lump rides out with

13
00:00:19,360 --> 00:00:20,320
the leftovers.

14
00:00:20,320 --> 00:00:22,320
Doctors say that usually takes a few

15
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:22,880
days.

16
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,560
Swallowing lots of gum can,

17
00:00:24,560 --> 00:00:25,040
rarely,

18
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:26,240
cause a blockage,

19
00:00:26,240 --> 00:00:27,600
so don't make a habit of it.

20
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,920
So your gum isn't staying seven years.

21
00:00:29,920 --> 00:00:32,436
It's just taking the long way out.
